<BaseLayout title="Our story" description="RURAL JAPAN is an English-language rural travel publication by UGATTA. An invitation to explore Japan with curiosity and care.">
  <section class="about-opening section-wrap" id="top"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p><h1>Another Japan.<br /><em>A little closer.</em></h1><div class="about-lead"><p>A publication for the curious.<br />An invitation to take your time.</p><p>RURAL JAPAN is an English-language travel media project by UGATTA, introducing international visitors to Japan’s rural places. We begin with Neba, a forested village in Nagano.</p></div></section>
  <div class="about-image section-wrap"><Photo id="fields" sizes="100vw" caption="Everyday landscapes · Neba, Nagano" /></div>
  <section class="about-values section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE SEE TRAVEL</p><div><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Small places matter.</h2><p>Our starting point is the village, the landscape and the detail. We want to make room for places that deserve a closer look.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Curiosity, with care.</h2><p>Beautiful places are also people’s homes. We encourage respectful visits, time spent locally and attention to the rhythms of everyday life.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>A story with a source.</h2><p>Our destination introductions link to local information. Photographs carry credits, and their sources and reuse terms are available in our image register.</p><a class="text-link" href="/credits/">View photo credits <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></section>
  <section class="about-colophon section-wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">PUBLISHED BY</p><h2>UGATTA</h2></div><div><p>This is the first edition of RURAL JAPAN. Our destination collection starts with Neba and will grow one place at a time.</p><p>No bookings, paid placements or affiliate links are currently offered.</p><a class="text-link" href="/places/neba/">Begin in Neba <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
